# DianaSh golden corpus. Recorded from the C# shell, byte for byte; EMUSEN_DIANASH_GOLDEN=record rewrites it - see EmuSen_DianaSh.md §13.4.
# Patterns: <ROOT> is the sandbox's real root, <TEMP> the corpus's real temporary folder, <INSTALL> the install's real directory;
# a 'match' block is a regular expression the whole output must match, written where a line prints a time or a measured number.
command readers
usage 1   readers <addr> [<scanstart> <scanlen>]
usage 2                                 find instructions statically reading <addr>,
usage 3                                 scanning CpuBus (default: <addr>'s own bank, $8000-$FFFF)

case static reads on the fake target
target fake
covers 1-3
$ readers
out 45
Usage: readers <addr> [<scanstart> <scanlen>]
status 0
action none
$ readers 42
out 20
  $008003: LDA $0042
status 0
action none
$ readers 43
out 20
  $008010: LDA $0043
status 0
action none
$ readers 42 8000 4
out 20
  $008003: LDA $0042
status 0
action none
$ readers 9999
out 67
No statically-resolvable reads of $009999 found in $008000-$00FFFF.
status 0
action none
end

case with no target
target none
covers 1
$ readers 42
out 65
Error: No ROM loaded - this command needs an active debug target.
status 1
action none
end

case on venus
target venus
covers 1-3
$ readers 2100
out 67
No statically-resolvable reads of $002100 found in $008000-$00FFFF.
status 0
action none
$ readers 0 0 100
out 67
No statically-resolvable reads of $000000 found in $000000-$0000FF.
status 0
action none
end

case on moonrt
target moonrt
covers 1-3
$ readers 2100
out 67
No statically-resolvable reads of $002100 found in $008000-$00FFFF.
status 0
action none
$ readers 0 0 100
out 67
No statically-resolvable reads of $000000 found in $000000-$0000FF.
status 0
action none
end

case on mercuryrt
target mercuryrt
covers 1-3
$ readers 2100
out 67
No statically-resolvable reads of $002100 found in $008000-$00FFFF.
status 0
action none
$ readers 0 0 100
out 67
No statically-resolvable reads of $000000 found in $000000-$0000FF.
status 0
action none
end

case on nephrite
target nephrite
covers 1-3
$ readers 2100
out 67
No statically-resolvable reads of $002100 found in $008000-$00FFFF.
status 0
action none
$ readers 0 0 100
out 67
No statically-resolvable reads of $000000 found in $000000-$0000FF.
status 0
action none
end
